# txn registrations; regenerate with: go test ./internal/wire -run TestTxnRegistrationsGolden -update
hook rights_begin authz github.com/OWNER/bothy/services/server/internal/authz/app.(*RightsHook).Begin-fm
hook rights_check authz github.com/OWNER/bothy/services/server/internal/authz/app.(*RightsHook).BeforeCommit-fm
hook sync sync github.com/OWNER/bothy/services/server/internal/sync/app.(*PhaseHook).Run-fm
hook audit audit github.com/OWNER/bothy/services/server/internal/audit/app.(*Chain).Hook-fm
subscribe messaging.MessagePosted -> sync github.com/OWNER/bothy/services/server/internal/sync/app.(*Subscribers).OnMessagePosted-fm
subscribe chat.ThreadMoved -> messaging github.com/OWNER/bothy/services/server/internal/messaging/app.(*Subscribers).OnThreadMoved-fm
subscribe chat.ThreadMoved -> sync github.com/OWNER/bothy/services/server/internal/sync/app.(*Subscribers).OnThreadMoved-fm
subscribe chat.ChannelArchived -> notify github.com/OWNER/bothy/services/server/internal/notify/app.(*Subscribers).OnChannelArchived-fm
subscribe chat.SpaceArchived -> notify github.com/OWNER/bothy/services/server/internal/notify/app.(*Subscribers).OnSpaceArchived-fm
subscribe messaging.MessagePosted -> runs github.com/OWNER/bothy/services/server/internal/runs/app.(*Acceptor).OnMessagePosted-fm
subscribe chat.ChannelArchived -> apps github.com/OWNER/bothy/services/server/internal/apps/app.(*ArchiveSubscriber).OnChannelArchived-fm
subscribe kernel.AccessChanged -> terminal github.com/OWNER/bothy/services/server/internal/terminal/app.(*Subscribers).OnAccessChanged-fm
subscribe identity.DeviceRevoked -> terminal github.com/OWNER/bothy/services/server/internal/terminal/app.(*Subscribers).OnDeviceRevoked-fm
subscribe identity.SessionEnded -> terminal github.com/OWNER/bothy/services/server/internal/terminal/app.(*Subscribers).OnSessionEnded-fm
